Steps for Policy implementation

Install ansible tool 
step 1 - sudo apt update
	 sudo apt install ansible -y
	 
Setup SSH Access to Clients
step 2 - ssh-keygen -t rsa -b 4096
step 3 - create a host.ini ( 192.168.2.111 ansible_user=testuser2 )
 
script - 
'''
for host in $(cat hosts.ini | grep -v '^\['); do
  ssh-copy-id user@$host
done
'''

test the connectivity - ansible -i hosts.ini ubuntu_servers -m ping

step 4 - ssh-copy-id ssh-copy-id testuser2@192.168.2.111

create a playbook 
step 5 - ansible-playbook wallpaper_lock.yml

Run the playbook - ansible-playbook -i hosts.ini set_wallpaper.yml


removing the playbook from host machine - 
sudo rm -f /etc/dconf/profile/user
sudo dconf update

